16
01:20:00,000 --> 01:20:06,000
The film was theatrically released on 18 January 2013, by Universal Pictures.

17
01:25:00,000 --> 01:25:06,000
Mama received positive reviews from critics, although its story was criticized, and was a
box office success, grossing $148 million against a $15 million budget.

